    {
        "text": "I turned down his kind invitation."
    },
    {
        "text": "But as I walked home, my heart was filled with some nameless emotion."
    },
    {
        "text": "One I have never felt before."
    },
    {
        "text": "That night, I lay on my bed, tossing and turning. I got no sleep at all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the sun rose, I had packed all my things\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
