        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster",
        "text": "Umiri. There's been a situation with the boss, and he wants you to take some of the heat."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "But I already decided to..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster",
        "text": "We've made arrangements with the prison. They're waiting for you downstairs."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster",
        "text": "Here's your payment. If you don't think it's enough, we can always add more."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#3$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster",
        "text": "Umiri, what's gotten into you today? I say something?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster",
        "text": "This is how it's always been, yeah? This is the deal\u2014we pay up, you do the job."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster",
        "text": "C'mon, get going. We'll find a way to get your sentence down to six months. That's no time at all. You'll be out before you know it."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
