    {
        "text": "As a hired hand, it's not uncommon at all to have to be the fall guy. I know my way around life in prison."
    },
    {
        "text": "But just this one time, this one single time, I suffered like nothing else."
    },
    {
        "text": "For six months, there wasn't a single moment that I wasn't thinking of getting out, of returning to the famiglia, to their band's parties."
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd found for myself where I belonged."
    },
    {
        "text": "But I never thought it would end like this\u2014"
    },
    {
